PC Controls: 
Left Shift to Sprint;
Left Control to Crouch;
M to open Settings;
Z to Unlock Mouse;
F to use Flashlight.

Console Controls:
L2 to Sprint;
Button B to Crouch;
DPad Down to open Settings;
Button Y to use Flashlight.
